We have a functor

\begin{align*}
F^{\rho}_{\mathcal{H}}: {\bf Mod}(\mathfrak{gl}(m,n)) &\rightarrow {\bf WMod}_{A_{m,n}}(\mathcal{W}(m,n))\\
(V,\theta) & \mapsto \Big(V\otimes P; \theta\vartriangleright\rho|_{A_{m,n}}, \theta\vartriangleright \rho|_{\mathcal{W}(m,n)} \Big).
\end{align*}
